        <h1>Bhelpuri Recipe</h1>
        <p> In this recipe we are going to learn how to make no fire food in which we will made bhelpuri....</p>
        <h2> Ingredients</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>tomato</li>
           <li>onion</li>
           <li>murmura</li>
            <li>bhujia namkeen</li>
             <li>4 different ketchups or sauces</li>
              <li>basic masale with maggie masala</li>
               <li>mixture namkeen</li>
                <li>makhana</li>
                </ul>
                <h2>Instructions</h2>
                <ol>
                  <li>first peel out onion and tomato</li>
                  <li>now, add murmura and both namkeens in a tumbler</li>
                  <li>add all masale and makhanas, and then mix with ketcups</li>
                  <li>mix it well</li>
                  </ol>
